---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Benedictus Abigail Triwiyatno"
  description="Privacy Policy for the web development portfolio of Benedictus Abigail Triwiyatno."
>
  <main id="main-content" class="min-h-screen bg-bg py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
      <div className="mb-12">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-mono text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors mb-8 group"
        >
          <span class="transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-1">←</span>
          <span>Back to Home</span>
        </a>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink mb-4">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-subtle">
          Last updated: January 11, 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-ink-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        <section class="rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white/60 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xs">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3 font-display">1. Introduction</h2>
          <p>
            Welcome to my portfolio website. Your privacy is important to me. This Privacy Policy outlines how information is handled when you visit and browse this website.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white/60 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xs">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3 font-display">2. Information Collection</h2>
          <p>
            This website is a professional portfolio and does not actively collect personally identifiable information unless you choose to contact me directly via WhatsApp, email, or social media links.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4">
            Aggregated, non-personally identifiable analytical information (such as general browser type or page visit counts) may be collected to monitor site reliability and performance.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white/60 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xs">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3 font-display">3. How Information is Handled</h2>
          <p>
            Any communication details you provide during consultations are strictly used to respond to your project inquiries and business requests. Your contact information is never sold, leased, or distributed to third parties.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white/60 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xs">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3 font-display">4. Storage and Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            This website stores your language preference (English or Indonesian) locally in your browser through local storage to provide a consistent viewing experience. No third-party marketing tracking cookies are utilized.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white/60 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xs">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3 font-display">5. Policy Updates</h2>
          <p>
            This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically to reflect improvements in site functionality or legal requirements. Updated versions will be published directly on this page with an updated date.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white/60 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xs">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3 font-display">6. Inquiries</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please reach out directly through the contact options on the main page.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-line/60 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs text-ink-subtle">
        <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Benedictus Abigail Triwiyatno</span>
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors underline underline-offset-4">
          Return to Homepage
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
